## Troubleshooting

### Issue: Model not appearing in OpenClaw
```bash
# Check Ollama is running
curl http://127.0.0.1:11434/api/tags

# Check OpenClaw config
grep -A5 -B5 ollama ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json

# Restart services
ollama serve &
openclaw gateway restart
```

### Issue: Poor tool calling performance
1. Test with simpler prompts first
2. Check if model supports OpenClaw's agent format
3. Consider using as fallback only, not primary

